# Objects (product language)

User-facing copy for anything you can add to the canvas (pills, words, shapes, emoji, images, GIFs, YouTube, etc.) uses **object** / **objects**.

- Prefer: object, objects, this object, selected object, first object
- Avoid in UI copy: piece, pieces, asset, assets (for canvas items)
- Section title for the create list: **Objects**
- Internal code names (`slot`, `chip`, `assetAnimsFrozen`, file paths) can stay; match UI strings when you touch them
